1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,340
The cable just snapped, forty floors up.

2
00:00:03,390 --> 00:00:07,000
Before you jump, you should know the

3
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:09,570
elevator was built for this exact moment.

4
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:13,340
Elevators make eighteen billion passenger trips a

5
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:15,980
year in America alone, and the number

6
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:18,770
that plunge to the bottom is almost zero.

7
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:22,780
Your car hangs from four to eight

8
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:25,760
steel ropes, and any single one of

9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:28,710
them can hold the entire cabin by itself.

10
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:33,210
Even if every rope failed, a speed

11
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:35,310
governor trips a brake that bites into

12
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:39,380
the guide rails, an idea from eighteen fifty three.

13
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:42,540
At the bottom of every shaft sits

14
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:45,400
a buffer, a giant piston of oil

15
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:49,170
or springs, built to catch a runaway car.

16
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:53,290
Instinct says jump at the last second,

17
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,550
but you would need to leap upward

18
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:59,060
at the car's full speed, which nobody can.

19
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:03,020
Lie flat on your back instead, arms

20
00:01:03,070 --> 00:01:06,360
and legs spread wide, so the impact

21
00:01:06,410 --> 00:01:09,150
spreads across your whole body and not your spine.

22
00:01:10,410 --> 00:01:12,840
In nineteen forty five a bomber struck

23
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:15,220
the Empire State Building and one elevator

24
00:01:15,270 --> 00:01:19,210
operator fell seventy five floors and survived.

25
00:01:20,770 --> 00:01:23,660
She lived because the severed cables piled

26
00:01:23,710 --> 00:01:25,520
up beneath her car like a spring,

27
00:01:25,570 --> 00:01:29,070
and trapped air in the shaft slowed the fall.

28
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:33,010
The far likelier emergency is a stalled

29
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:35,990
car, so press the alarm, use the

30
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:39,020
intercom, and never force the doors open yourself.

31
00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:43,950
Here is the twist, many passengers hurt

32
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,430
by elevators were climbing out of a

33
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:49,420
stuck car, not riding one that fell.

34
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:53,130
So if it drops, lie flat, and

35
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:56,050
if it merely stops, sit down and

36
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:59,380
wait, because the box is safer than the shaft.
